         <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/introduction/access_sms_mobile_application.dita" xtrc="p:1;27:13">To access the SMS mobile application, you can use a smartphone or a tablet with an Android or iOS operating system.</p>
         <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/introduction/access_sms_mobile_application.dita" xtrc="p:2;28:13">Note<b class="+ topic/ph hi-d/b " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/introduction/access_sms_mobile_application.dita" xtrc="b:1;28:20">:</b> You cannot use a Windows tablet.</p>
         <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/introduction/access_sms_mobile_application.dita" xtrc="p:3;29:13">The following OS versions are compatible with the SMS mobile app:</p>
         <ul id="ul_10211402" class="- topic/ul " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/introduction/access_sms_mobile_application.dita" xtrc="ul:1;30:31">
            <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/introduction/access_sms_mobile_application.dita" xtrc="li:1;31:17">Android: OS6.0 or later</li>
            <li class="- topic/li " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/introduction/access_sms_mobile_application.dita" xtrc="li:2;32:17">iOS13 or later</li>
         </ul>
         <p class="- topic/p " xtrf="file:/C:/Users/adity/Downloads/Analytics%20User%20Guide/output/introduction/access_sms_mobile_application.dita" xtrc="p:4;34:13">To download the SMS mobile app:</p>
      </context>
